[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13380.63, "timestamp": "03:43:00", "text": "所以基本上，我坐上了那辆公交车。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13383.11, "timestamp": "03:43:03", "text": "之后就停了下来，我以前喜欢……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13385.19, "timestamp": "03:43:05", "text": "那辆自动汽车好像在附近启动了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13391.469, "timestamp": "03:43:11", "text": "我猜大概5公里要200元。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13395.59, "timestamp": "03:43:15", "text": "五是六。六七个。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13398.87, "timestamp": "03:43:18", "text": "原来如此。好的。所以，听着。呃，从我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13402.15, "timestamp": "03:43:22", "text": "我是本地人，我要来到这座城市。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13403.67, "timestamp": "03:43:23", "text": "正确的？从那里，我得搭公交车。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13406.87, "timestamp": "03:43:26", "text": "为了我的大学，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13408.87, "timestamp": "03:43:28", "text": "那东西才12卢比左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13414.389, "timestamp": "03:43:34", "text": "比如，公交车票价只要12卢比。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13416.87, "timestamp": "03:43:36", "text": "我。但是，在知道我之前……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13418.79, "timestamp": "03:43:38", "text": "每次都要花200块钱才能买到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13427.349, "timestamp": "03:43:47", "text": "我当时就想，老兄，我浪费了好多钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13435.55, "timestamp": "03:43:55", "text": "哦，是的。我想问问大学生活怎么样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13438.309, "timestamp": "03:43:58", "text": "生活？就像印地语电影里那样吗？"}]